  "job_A3.22.26_20260920_210247": {
    "text": "Mec feonda sum feore besny\u00feede, woruldstrenga binom, w\u00e6tte si\u00fe\u00fean, dyfde on w\u00e6tre, dyde eft \u00feonan,\nHeard mec si\u00fe\u00fean sna\u00f0 seaxses ecg, sindrum begrunden; fingras feoldan, ond mec fugles wyn geond\nMec si\u00fe\u00fean wrah h\u00e6le\u00f0 hleobordum, hyde be\u00feenede, gierede mec mid golde; for\u00feon me gliwedon\nNu \u00fea gereno ond se reada telg ond \u00fea wuldorgesteald wide m\u00e6re dryhtfolca helm, nales dol wite.\nGif min bearn wera brucan willa\u00f0, hy beo\u00f0 \u00fey gesundran ond \u00fey sigef\u00e6stran, heortum \u00fey hw\u00e6tran ond\nFrige hw\u00e6t ic hatte, ni\u00feum to nytte.\nNama min is m\u00e6re, h\u00e6le\u00feum gifre ond halig sylf.",
